        "slc_f31345b719e75593dae27673b1f3ef335753ae62ba73359613920855eb469590"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI is invoked as npx autospecai with a required --url flag and optional --model, --spec_limit, --apikey, --specFile, --help and --version flags."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1b261a2d1db8a4c7668be240d00e7e358ce10f79394335d813f08abc9e3eb0eb",
