        "slc_7369a886ab171755f7debd47fedeec3f4c2da151c671190106411668003de472"
      ],
      "text": "If --apikey is omitted, the tool falls back on ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, or GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY environment variables; keys can also be configured via a .env file."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
